OL,3,GNEWSAMicrosoft set to submit new data
OL,4,Acentre project
OL,5,
OL,6,FMicrosoft is set to submit a plan for a
OL,7,Fnew data centre later this autumn.
OL,9,FIt wants to use a site at the former
OL,10,FLangley Business Centre, near Langley
OL,11,Fand Windsor College in Station Road,
OL,12,Fwhich has been vacant since December
OL,13,F2023.
OL,15,FSlough Borough Council previously
OL,16,Fapproved an outline plan for a data
OL,17,Fcentre there in 2021 but this
OL,18,Fapplication has now lapsed.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
