OL,3,GNEWSAMicrosoft set to submit new data
OL,4,Acentre project
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome people have said they are
OL,7,Fconcerned about the proliferation of
OL,8,Fdata centres in Slough, with worries
OL,9,Fbeing raised over noise, the heat
OL,10,Fgenerated by them and potential health
OL,11,Fimpacts.
